        "### **Part 5: Compare Several Candidate Models** — 📚 REFERENCE\n",
        "The helper function below is provided for you. **You are not expected to write this function yourself.**\n",
        "\n",
        "It automates the same three steps you already used manually:\n",
        "1. fit a model on `train`,\n",
        "2. forecast `len(test)` periods,\n",
        "3. calculate test-set MAE and RMSE.\n"
      ]
    },
